dataset/data/
# Belt and braces: the OAS/SAbDab downloaders resolve the repo root from their own location, and a
# wrong-depth `..` once wrote 154 MB into <repo>/cdrseqgen/dataset/, which the anchored pattern
# above does not match. This catches a stray data tree anywhere in the repo.
**/dataset/data/
*.token
/results/
old/
*/old/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
